Package: restlos-uninstaller
Version: @DEBIAN_VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: jurkast <jurkast@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jurkast/restlos-uninstaller
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, policykit-1, hicolor-icon-theme, openssl
Recommends: desktop-file-utils
Provides: restlos
Description: Safe Linux App & Game Uninstaller
 Restlos Uninstaller detects applications and games from native package
 managers, Flatpak, Snap, AppImage, Wine, Steam, Lutris, Heroic, Bottles,
 PlayOnLinux, and portable folders.
 .
 It shows a reviewable removal plan and can create Safety Backups before
 permanently deleting suitable settings and save data.
